WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.500
This is PipelineOS — a live full-stack CRM demonstration you can test right now at crm.aliarshad.co.

00:08.500 --> 00:19.500
Everything runs on Next.js, TypeScript, and PostgreSQL with realistic fictional B2B data. Start with one click on the sandbox demo login.

00:19.500 --> 00:33.500
Manage contacts with persistent communication notes, then convert qualified leads into a contact and pipeline deal in a single atomic transaction.

00:33.500 --> 00:46.000
Move deals across the six-stage Kanban pipeline to update stage totals and record an immutable stage history entry.

00:46.000 --> 00:54.000
Open Analytics to see funnel conversion rates and revenue calculated directly from live PostgreSQL records.

00:54.000 --> 01:00.000
Try it yourself at crm.aliarshad.co and click Reset Demo Data anytime to restore the sandbox.
